<title>UK: Thermo Fibertek adds $50 mln to convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Thermo Fibertek adds $50 mln to convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following converbible bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Salomon, has been increased to $150 million from $100 million, and priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THERMO FIBERTEK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THERMO ELECTRON CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     4.5	 MATURITY    15.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PREMIUM     19.51 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A-/BAA3   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	THREE YEAR NO HARD CALL</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PRICE $12.10, YIELD TO MATURITY 4.5 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
